<title>NORWAY: Norway's Q1 1997 GDP up 0.5 pct - stats office.</title>
<headline>Norway's Q1 1997 GDP up 0.5 pct - stats office.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics Norway gave the following figures for year-on-year percentage changes to key economic indicators in the first quarter of 1997 with changes from the fourth quarter of 1996 as comparison.</p>
<p>				     Q1 97     Changes from Q4 96</p>
<p> GDP overall			0.5	  -0.1</p>
<p> GDP mainland		    -0.5	  -0.5</p>
<p> Oil activity and</p>
<p> overseas shipping		5.1	   2.0</p>
<p> Private consumption	    1.4	  -0.9</p>
<p> Public consumption	     2.8	   0.4</p>
<p> Export			     0.4	  -3.2</p>
<p> Import			     5.1	  -0.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Changes from Q4 are seasonally adjusted.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
